AdhSQzvfIH-K0xEpXPB7fEQE3GbDjWLQ8ETzf16rczaw&oe=6A58F544"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QBVflbKl50oQ7kNvwFtVfXW&_nc_oc=AdqU6tyEi1gwleD7PbeP3yD0su4ahxf8hByFan4RATTB_uA6Tba1UEsRwQxOS3kTCy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCUo4YbwXn6aZWae2zv3TLGC0sK11fC1KgSJTbs0VE8pw&oe=6A58D9E2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=43uyPAhr6KYQ7kNvwH-jwIN&_nc_oc=AdoSFf-aRHoJmo9v-YL82ioSOGgHg3tBLaRnKyHIiNMW6zJ3OYSo-4ee9XfwXs3EdFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBnzSL7tXLHeW5osLje_fXntIKdcyisoRIj5ivmlERM8Q&oe=6A58C3F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D-9vpuirp_IQ7kNvwE8LPlO&_nc_oc=AdrG7HvdyE5mbOe2NZiL3not4ywocrDNbHGbPFK-ys14ojgmDpUXgqxKLrbErjAhqOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAgv4n1W3TmuWdErXENJs5w7uz3cQwNuoP-tczjdrwukg&oe=6A58C2EF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YRmPD2doEx8Q7kNvwGw3hch&_nc_oc=AdrZbJS-1C7xQg5JyvT35Xb_UVhau7ieYk5UB1-Immj1Vj-xbNVZh-zaSl-JdfQwfmM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCNHZJGjEtLjPG5ydliT4xP9apce79nK0-E_uliTUpC2A&oe=6A58F725"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gipQZ8cL2pMQ7kNvwGqqNYt&_nc_oc=Adr3LNGZQp8USp8M4svvqRLMAWK_lFOquq04NH5BwqaRJdKr8uBkFQ5FC91mc0AvrvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBIDdpvsuzqzKottPbwwo6hYzJnqqRz5aXulLQ0Eic8Fw&oe=6A58F60D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0dZ7NLrzPSMQ7kNvwHV9QSt&_nc_oc=AdqdbKXSmaXPi3xuTlZ_vwCA7FYfBPayRUhu4IXOWNJd4hxNDZBuNeX1SSgImxIzpn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=